{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐喜欢上了一个愿意与他亲近的人，却始终害怕自己的感情太多，会让对方退缩。他从小心翼翼地隐藏，到终于坦露心意、尽情陪伴，最后接受无法保证永远，只决定不再隐藏喜欢，珍惜眼前的亲近。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却不敢说\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又怕结束\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"只想沉浸当下\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"心意露出后慌乱\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方没变他却孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼自己也被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"主动亲近仍忧未来\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕终有一天被冷落\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"停止猜测享受当下\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"愿陪伴却无法决定未来\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再克制尽情去爱\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要保证又收不回爱\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求永远不再隐藏\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S06到S07：刚刚因为对方没有疏远而安心，马上又转向孤独和猜测对方是否也需要自己，情绪转折比较微妙。最抓人的是S05和S13，前者是心意被看穿后的失重感，后者是明明害怕受伤却已经无法收回喜欢。S14把最初的小心翼翼和最后的坦然接在一起，让整个故事有了清楚的落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7b0c3845-0e4a-4c50-8e31-40841a90c888", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190549539746Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:06:24.238148+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "586e21c9ab5a8f500a153f2f638739f58cccf903ea8ae319d78d49eb4fa49df1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190549539746Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4977802a749d83b2be10bec35c7ae10858b65c3f36a62d7c7f8d47acfde92764"}}}
